WEBVTT

01:18.310 --> 01:21.910
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:22.020 --> 01:24.950
[Episode 33]

01:37.509 --> 01:38.350
Thank you so much.

01:38.350 --> 01:39.810
You're welcome. Goodbye.

01:50.470 --> 01:52.070
Excuse me. Please sign here.

02:33.700 --> 02:40.579
♪ What matters to me is what you need ♪

02:41.690 --> 02:47.950
♪ Nothing more, nothing less,
I just hope it's something I can give ♪

02:48.670 --> 02:54.980
♪ What I cherish is what I have ♪

02:56.490 --> 03:02.150
♪ Every little moment,
I hope you're there with me ♪

03:03.350 --> 03:07.160
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

03:08.950 --> 03:11.180
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

03:11.560 --> 03:15.760
♪ Truths, lies,
and words said just for show ♪

03:16.540 --> 03:18.190
♪ Feel like I'm walking on cotton ♪

03:18.700 --> 03:22.800
♪ Harsh words, lies,
and words I can't make sense of ♪

03:23.630 --> 03:25.470
♪ Pretentious words wrapped
in glitter and glamour ♪

03:25.840 --> 03:30.010
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

03:30.750 --> 03:34.620
♪ Under your fiery eyes ♪

03:44.890 --> 03:48.940
[Daisy flower language: You're the love
I've hidden deep down inside.]

03:50.570 --> 03:54.210
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

03:51.400 --> 03:53.010
Wow, you really bought it?

03:54.079 --> 03:56.180
I have to say, it looks pretty good.

03:55.110 --> 03:58.280
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

03:56.520 --> 03:57.240
You like it?

03:57.710 --> 03:58.560
It's yours.

03:58.680 --> 03:59.150
Really?

03:58.850 --> 04:02.790
♪ Truths, lies,
and words said just for show ♪

04:03.790 --> 04:05.280
♪ Feel like I'm walking on cotton ♪

04:05.980 --> 04:09.940
♪ Harsh words, lies,
and words I can't make sense of ♪

04:10.840 --> 04:12.630
♪ Pretentious words wrapped
in glitter and glamour ♪

04:13.060 --> 04:17.019
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

04:17.980 --> 04:21.670
♪ Under your fiery eyes ♪

04:37.070 --> 04:39.600
Who could have thought
it would end like this,

04:39.680 --> 04:41.460
with him just moving out?

04:41.950 --> 04:44.070
She's your best friend.
You didn't know her?

04:44.070 --> 04:46.120
You both have strong minds of your own.

04:46.120 --> 04:48.500
Say, if I had just told Fei

04:48.830 --> 04:50.360
that after Li Yifei
went to Peach Blossom Village,

04:50.360 --> 04:52.420
he couldn't stop thinking about her,

04:52.430 --> 04:53.090
would things

04:53.090 --> 04:54.560
have ended happily today?

04:55.830 --> 04:56.430
It's fine.

04:56.950 --> 04:57.590
Let me tell you,

04:57.590 --> 04:59.520
just leave this to time.

05:43.590 --> 05:44.380
[Pretentious Li]

05:46.720 --> 05:49.670
Sorry, the subscriber
you dialed is turned off.

05:49.800 --> 05:51.420
Is he on a plane,

05:51.830 --> 05:53.360
or did he change his number?

06:25.720 --> 06:26.430
Miss.

06:26.750 --> 06:28.360
Do you have a smaller portion of okra?

06:28.360 --> 06:30.090
I can't finish it all by myself.

06:30.360 --> 06:32.120
Yes. Wait a moment. I'll get one for you.

06:32.120 --> 06:32.920
Okay, thanks.

06:47.430 --> 06:48.310
[Pretentious Li]

06:53.270 --> 06:53.750
Hello?

06:54.830 --> 06:56.430
I... I lost my phone.

06:56.430 --> 06:57.630
It's been off all day.

06:58.600 --> 06:59.480
I just got a new one.

06:59.480 --> 07:01.680
I saw a notification that you called me.

07:02.360 --> 07:03.820
Is there something wrong?

07:04.510 --> 07:06.120
I found an e-reader at home.

07:06.120 --> 07:07.510
I wanted to ask if it's yours.

07:07.510 --> 07:09.270
If it is, give me an address.

07:09.300 --> 07:10.360
I'll mail it to you.

07:12.390 --> 07:14.520
I don't need it now. Just throw it away.

07:15.720 --> 07:16.310
Okay.

07:17.920 --> 07:18.580
Is...

07:19.190 --> 07:20.720
Is there... anything else?

07:21.310 --> 07:22.080
Excuse me.

07:22.240 --> 07:23.240
This one is smaller.

07:23.240 --> 07:25.170
It should be enough for one person.

07:25.720 --> 07:26.450
Thanks.

07:27.980 --> 07:29.340
There's nothing else.

07:29.510 --> 07:30.190
That's all.

07:43.190 --> 07:44.850
Excuse me. Please take a look.

07:47.240 --> 07:47.970
Excuse me...

07:48.360 --> 07:48.930
Fei?

07:49.270 --> 07:51.120
It's me. Don't you remember?

07:51.950 --> 07:54.510
A year ago
you listed a room for rent at our agency.

07:54.510 --> 07:56.110
Do you have any listings now?

07:56.680 --> 07:57.409
I...

07:59.720 --> 08:02.100
I'll contact you if I do.

08:02.190 --> 08:04.190
Alright. My number is on here.

08:04.210 --> 08:05.610
Call me anytime you need.

08:05.810 --> 08:06.690
Okay. Thanks.

08:06.720 --> 08:07.370
Goodbye.

08:51.750 --> 08:54.280
It feels like
drinking beer in the living room

08:54.630 --> 08:55.430
with Li Yifei

08:55.460 --> 08:57.200
was a century ago.

08:57.890 --> 08:59.530
Like it has been a long time.

09:13.510 --> 09:14.910
Why are you here today?

09:14.910 --> 09:16.120
We're so lucky.

09:16.360 --> 09:17.550
I usually run errands outside.

09:17.550 --> 09:19.270
It's rare for me
to come back to the office.

09:19.270 --> 09:21.530
I'm here for a project progress meeting.

09:22.200 --> 09:22.910
Fei.

09:23.320 --> 09:26.160
They say a woman in love
has the best skin.

09:26.600 --> 09:28.960
You're glowing.
You seem to be doing really well lately.

09:28.960 --> 09:31.080
Tell me, are you dating someone?

09:31.150 --> 09:32.320
If you don't gossip about me,

09:32.320 --> 09:34.180
do you have nothing to talk about?

09:35.390 --> 09:36.910
Did you come alone today?

09:37.440 --> 09:37.920
Yes.

09:39.630 --> 09:40.870
You don't work for Li Yifei anymore?

09:40.870 --> 09:42.690
I do. He's my boss.

09:42.870 --> 09:44.530
Then why didn't he come today?

09:45.120 --> 09:45.910
Don't mention it.

09:45.910 --> 09:48.540
He has been dealing with
a lot of problems lately.

09:48.540 --> 09:49.740
What happened to him?

09:50.320 --> 09:52.580
Before he took on
the Shanlifang Hotel Group project,

09:52.580 --> 09:54.750
he was handling a convertible bond offering
for another company.

09:54.750 --> 09:56.390
Everyone had prepared all the materials,

09:56.390 --> 09:58.750
but while they were waiting
for the client's confirmation,

09:58.750 --> 10:01.600
they found out
that the bonds had already been issued.

10:01.600 --> 10:04.270
They said it was because Zhizhong Investment
asked for too much money.

10:04.270 --> 10:06.440
They used the full set of materials
Boss had prepared

10:06.440 --> 10:08.960
and secretly hired another brokerage
to handle the deal.

10:08.960 --> 10:10.090
That's despicable.

10:10.910 --> 10:13.690
But this is between
the company and the client.

10:13.790 --> 10:15.790
What does it have to do with Li Yifei?

10:17.630 --> 10:19.830
I knew you wanted to know what happened.

10:20.120 --> 10:20.870
The usual.

10:26.240 --> 10:28.440
[Send]

10:28.460 --> 10:28.870
[WeChat Pay]

10:31.020 --> 10:31.390
[Qian Fei]

10:31.410 --> 10:32.790
[Wish You Prosperity]

10:32.820 --> 10:32.960
[Loading]

10:33.010 --> 10:35.810
[Wish You Prosperity]

10:35.830 --> 10:36.310
[Red Packet from Qian Fei]

10:37.080 --> 10:37.790
Thanks.

10:38.320 --> 10:39.440
Since they didn't reach an agreement,

10:39.440 --> 10:40.720
they had to go to court.

10:41.000 --> 10:43.070
But the lawyer the company hired

10:43.120 --> 10:45.120
insisted that a guarantee agreement
was missing

10:45.120 --> 10:47.320
and claimed that it had been handed over
to Yifei earlier.

10:47.320 --> 10:48.320
But during that time, I don't know

10:48.320 --> 10:49.910
what was going on with Yifei,

10:49.910 --> 10:51.320
but he seemed kind of out of it.

10:51.320 --> 10:52.150
He himself wasn't sure

10:52.150 --> 10:54.360
if he had kept
the guarantee agreement safe.

10:54.360 --> 10:55.000
And then,

10:55.000 --> 10:57.670
this lawyer printed out
all the relevant communication records

10:57.670 --> 10:59.440
and had them notarized.

10:59.750 --> 11:01.150
At that critical moment,

11:01.510 --> 11:02.630
he lost his phone.

11:03.630 --> 11:05.830
Well... didn't he still have his email?

11:06.080 --> 11:08.360
Don't mention it.
His email was probably hacked,

11:08.360 --> 11:09.600
and all the data inside was deleted.

11:09.600 --> 11:11.330
He didn't make a backup either.

11:11.720 --> 11:12.850
This lawyer

11:12.910 --> 11:15.290
just wants to put the blame on Yifei,

11:15.390 --> 11:18.030
insisting that he was paid off
by the other side

11:18.630 --> 11:20.360
and was planning to throw the case.

11:20.360 --> 11:21.870
Li Yifei is absolutely
not that kind of person.

11:21.870 --> 11:22.690
Exactly.

11:22.870 --> 11:24.320
No one in our office believes

11:24.320 --> 11:25.550
that Yifei could do such a thing.

11:25.550 --> 11:27.010
But Yifei was really weird

11:27.550 --> 11:28.700
during that time.

11:29.390 --> 11:31.790
He lost the documents and his phone.

11:31.910 --> 11:33.390
He even logged into something as important

11:33.390 --> 11:35.630
as his email account on a public computer.

11:35.630 --> 11:37.530
Maybe he forgot to log out,

11:37.670 --> 11:39.270
and that's how it got hacked.

11:39.360 --> 11:40.890
But I remember that before,

11:40.960 --> 11:42.870
there seemed to be
a lot of first-hand materials.

11:42.870 --> 11:44.390
Didn't they all pass through your hands?

11:44.390 --> 11:45.390
During that time,

11:45.390 --> 11:47.670
I was arranged by the company
to study out of town for a week.

11:47.670 --> 11:48.600
When I came back,

11:49.120 --> 11:50.720
Boss was already in trouble.

11:50.960 --> 11:53.490
I told you
he couldn't do anything without me.

11:54.750 --> 11:55.870
Compared to Li Yifei,

11:55.870 --> 11:57.150
I feel like the new lawyer you hired

11:57.150 --> 11:58.080
is the real mole.

11:59.720 --> 12:00.510
I guess...

12:01.720 --> 12:04.260
That lawyer is just taking revenge.

12:04.790 --> 12:07.080
Wasn't Yifei in a bad mood
during that time?

12:07.080 --> 12:08.550
He was quite irritable.

12:08.720 --> 12:10.550
This lawyer is always arrogant,

12:10.630 --> 12:12.690
making everyone cooperate with him.

12:13.550 --> 12:15.550
Yifei talked back to him a few times,

12:15.600 --> 12:17.800
making him quite embarrassed.

12:18.390 --> 12:20.270
He just happened
to find some leverage against him.

12:20.270 --> 12:22.000
Can't he do something about it?

12:22.870 --> 12:25.160
Then what will happen next?

12:25.670 --> 12:27.800
Well, technically, nothing serious.

12:28.200 --> 12:29.910
But the problem is that this lawyer

12:29.910 --> 12:32.070
has some connection to the board.

12:32.630 --> 12:35.080
If he's just talking nonsense
and we ignore it, that's fine.

12:35.080 --> 12:37.120
But if the higher-ups
actually listen to him,

12:37.120 --> 12:39.670
Boss might not be able
to stay in the company anymore.

12:39.670 --> 12:40.960
Then we really have to find

12:40.960 --> 12:42.490
that guarantee agreement.

12:44.120 --> 12:45.180
How?

12:45.480 --> 12:48.540
His phone, his email, and the data—
everything's gone.

12:53.450 --> 12:59.710
[Xinzouqi Capital Co., Ltd.]

12:59.390 --> 13:00.100
Shan.

13:00.550 --> 13:02.600
Can you send me

13:02.620 --> 13:03.680
the original file?

13:03.910 --> 13:05.000
Give me a few minutes.

13:05.000 --> 13:07.730
I'm backing up my phone
to the computer right now.

13:07.780 --> 13:09.840
I'll send it to you as soon as I'm done.

13:10.030 --> 13:10.440
Okay.

13:10.550 --> 13:11.010
Thanks.

13:23.440 --> 13:24.100
Idiot.

13:24.870 --> 13:25.930
What are you doing?

13:26.800 --> 13:29.150
Transferring data from my phone
to my computer.

13:29.150 --> 13:31.410
I want to do it too. Can you help me?

13:31.950 --> 13:35.750
Are you stupid? You don't even know
how to do this? Give me your phone.

13:37.240 --> 13:38.370
Wait until I'm done.

13:39.630 --> 13:42.380
Even if the phone's gone,
the data's still there.

13:44.110 --> 13:45.240
[Xinzouqi Capital Co., Ltd.]

13:54.280 --> 13:56.060
[Hongqiao International Airport]
[Chengdu Tianfu International Airport]

13:56.810 --> 13:58.570
Hello, Xin You. It's Qian Fei.

14:00.320 --> 14:01.150
Here's the thing.

14:01.150 --> 14:03.150
Among the things I donated last time,

14:03.150 --> 14:05.550
there was an old computer.
Do you remember?

14:06.510 --> 14:07.840
Yes, I need it urgently.

14:09.670 --> 14:11.080
Great. As long as it's not lost.

14:11.080 --> 14:13.380
How about this?
I'll ask for leave today and go find you.

14:13.380 --> 14:16.170
[Hongqiao International Airport]
[Chengdu Tianfu International Airport]

14:17.480 --> 14:18.750
No, I must come.

14:18.870 --> 14:19.790
It saves time.

14:21.440 --> 14:23.310
Okay, that's it for now.
Let's keep in touch.

14:23.310 --> 14:27.320
[Xinzouqi Capital Co., Ltd.]

14:27.510 --> 14:28.990
[Book] [Shop] [Buy Now]

14:29.160 --> 14:29.950
[Price Guarantee] [Emergency Assistance]

14:30.320 --> 14:32.320
Didn't you say you weren't obsessed
with love anymore

14:32.320 --> 14:35.120
and could think maturely
about love in the future?

14:35.150 --> 14:38.010
Worrying about Li Yifei
and running around for him—

14:38.120 --> 14:39.200
does that look rational?

14:39.200 --> 14:40.000
Not being together with him

14:40.000 --> 14:42.800
is a choice I made
after considering many factors.

14:43.510 --> 14:46.040
But turning a blind eye
is not my style either.

14:46.270 --> 14:47.320
I can't care that much.

14:47.320 --> 14:48.980
Let's get through this first.

14:49.120 --> 14:51.070
You're completely doomed.

14:51.100 --> 14:53.100
You've fallen in love with Li Yifei.

14:53.440 --> 14:54.320
With the way you're acting,

14:54.320 --> 14:55.780
I certainly don't believe

14:55.780 --> 14:57.380
you don't want to be with him.

14:57.480 --> 14:59.660
No confidence in the future?

14:59.760 --> 15:02.130
I'd say your future
is closely tied to his.

15:03.390 --> 15:04.550
I don't know about anything else,

15:04.550 --> 15:05.560
but I know

15:05.670 --> 15:07.000
my future is closely tied

15:07.000 --> 15:08.000
to yours.

15:08.480 --> 15:10.340
I have to go now. I need to check in.

15:25.320 --> 15:32.240
♪ What matters to me is what you need ♪

15:33.310 --> 15:39.570
♪ Nothing more, nothing less,
I just hope it's something I can give ♪

15:40.290 --> 15:46.600
♪ What I cherish is what I have ♪

15:47.950 --> 15:53.890
♪ Every little moment,
I hope you're there with me ♪

15:54.870 --> 15:58.780
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

16:00.570 --> 16:02.740
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

16:03.180 --> 16:07.380
♪ Truths, lies,
and words said just for show ♪

16:08.160 --> 16:09.880
♪ Feel like I'm walking on cotton ♪

16:10.310 --> 16:14.490
♪ Harsh words, lies,
and words I can't make sense of ♪

16:10.510 --> 16:12.590
You're completely doomed.

16:12.670 --> 16:14.670
You've fallen in love with Li Yifei.

16:15.000 --> 16:15.790
With the way you're acting,

16:15.170 --> 16:17.160
♪ Pretentious words wrapped
in glitter and glamour ♪

16:15.790 --> 16:17.270
I certainly don't believe

16:17.270 --> 16:18.520
you don't want to be with him.

16:17.390 --> 16:21.750
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

16:19.120 --> 16:21.200
No confidence in the future?

16:21.360 --> 16:23.580
I'd say your future is
closely tied to his.

16:22.310 --> 16:26.320
♪ Under your fiery eyes ♪

16:35.930 --> 16:39.950
[Peach Blossom Village]

16:40.550 --> 16:41.360
Qian Fei is here.

16:41.360 --> 16:42.260
Qian Fei!

16:42.290 --> 16:43.130
Qian Fei!

16:43.150 --> 16:44.360
Qian Fei!

16:44.600 --> 16:45.910
Qian Fei!

16:46.480 --> 16:47.550
Qian Fei!

16:52.200 --> 16:53.130
Welcome, Qian Fei.

16:53.130 --> 16:56.590
-Xin You, long time no see.
-You must be tired from the journey.

16:57.590 --> 16:58.370
Xin Ba.

16:58.440 --> 16:59.890
Qian Fei,

17:00.030 --> 17:01.000
I missed you so much!

17:01.000 --> 17:02.070
I missed you guys too.

17:02.070 --> 17:03.240
The kids really like you.

17:03.240 --> 17:04.640
You've gotten prettier.

17:05.030 --> 17:06.240
You're so sweet.

17:06.260 --> 17:07.310
How was the trip?

17:07.400 --> 17:08.599
It was pretty smooth.

17:09.510 --> 17:11.390
The kids talk about you every day.

17:11.880 --> 17:13.079
They missed you a lot.

17:14.030 --> 17:15.510
-So cute.
-Thank goodness.

17:15.510 --> 17:17.950
A year ago,
you and Yifei came here and found me.

17:17.950 --> 17:19.640
Not only did it free my mind,

17:19.720 --> 17:21.900
but it also got Xin Ba treated,

17:22.069 --> 17:23.880
and allowed all the farmers
and breeders in the county

17:23.880 --> 17:25.599
to cooperate with Fulaxida.

17:25.829 --> 17:27.560
Ever since this app launched,

17:27.640 --> 17:30.030
our orders
have been booked out a year in advance.

17:30.030 --> 17:30.870
That's great.

17:30.900 --> 17:32.400
I heard that those customers

17:32.400 --> 17:35.510
have named the fields, calves, and lambs.

17:35.510 --> 17:36.310
That's right.

17:36.440 --> 17:38.070
Especially the cattle and sheep.

17:38.070 --> 17:39.750
Some customers even asked the farmers

17:39.750 --> 17:40.960
to take good care of them,
keep raising them,

17:40.960 --> 17:42.420
and never slaughter them.

17:42.920 --> 17:44.000
Li Yifei did

17:44.000 --> 17:45.720
such a good deed without telling anyone.

17:45.720 --> 17:47.640
Xin Ba, take Fei back home first.

17:47.720 --> 17:48.830
I'll go get the computer for you.

17:48.830 --> 17:50.230
-Okay. Let's go.
-Go now.

17:56.790 --> 17:58.190
Qian Fei, it's over here.

18:14.390 --> 18:15.390
Will it come over?

18:21.460 --> 18:23.400
You have more. It will eat yours.

18:24.480 --> 18:25.650
Qian Fei.

18:25.820 --> 18:27.320
Your phone.

18:36.970 --> 18:40.290
[All Things Grow]

18:42.650 --> 18:43.540
[HD] [Recording]

18:48.320 --> 18:49.410
[HD] [Recording]

18:49.930 --> 18:51.790
We can see them already?

18:53.510 --> 18:54.130
Qian Fei.

18:54.830 --> 18:55.930
I brought the computer back.

18:55.930 --> 18:56.870
Great.

18:58.790 --> 19:00.740
Kids, go out and play.

19:02.100 --> 19:03.330
Let's go out and play!

19:05.310 --> 19:05.840
Let's go.

19:11.110 --> 19:17.370
[Vice Director's Office]

19:16.890 --> 19:17.430
Look at

19:17.510 --> 19:19.340
the timeline and the person in charge.

19:17.640 --> 19:18.720
[This project is expected to be released]

19:18.720 --> 19:19.720
[on October 1, 2021.]

19:19.510 --> 19:20.480
I'm certain

19:20.480 --> 19:21.960
I gave this company's guarantee agreement

19:21.960 --> 19:22.890
to you back then.

19:25.160 --> 19:26.240
Impossible, Boss.

19:26.640 --> 19:28.640
I've checked many times. It's not with me.

19:28.640 --> 19:30.900
Think carefully—did you miss any place?

19:31.880 --> 19:34.110
Don't we put everything in the archives?

19:34.110 --> 19:36.510
Just now, you checked it
several times too.

19:45.440 --> 19:46.340
We're so lucky.

19:46.790 --> 19:49.750
This computer has been used by
the teachers this whole time.

19:49.750 --> 19:51.680
They didn't reinstall the system.

19:51.680 --> 19:52.860
The things you need

19:53.440 --> 19:54.640
should all be in here.

19:55.590 --> 19:59.120
But I remember they were on the desktop.

19:59.180 --> 20:00.650
[This PC] [Desktop]

19:59.310 --> 20:00.880
Why can't I find them now?

20:00.880 --> 20:03.030
Are you sure you put them on the desktop?

20:03.030 --> 20:03.750
I'm sure.

20:05.550 --> 20:07.140
Let me help you check.

20:07.510 --> 20:08.110
Okay.

20:14.480 --> 20:15.680
What's the file name?

20:16.350 --> 20:17.750
Li's Phone Backup.

20:22.400 --> 20:25.710
[Li's Phone Backup]

20:25.760 --> 20:26.020
[Li's Phone Backup] [Properties]

20:27.000 --> 20:28.670
Take a look. Is this it?

20:29.030 --> 20:29.870
This is it.

20:30.440 --> 20:32.320
How did you find it so quickly?

20:32.350 --> 20:34.460
You really did Li Yifei a huge favor.

20:32.420 --> 20:34.190
[Li's Phone Backup] [Properties]

20:35.200 --> 20:36.460
Didn't you do the same?

20:38.830 --> 20:40.390
We're friends. That's what friends do.

20:40.390 --> 20:43.110
[Application Result] [Company Backup Data]

20:46.140 --> 20:46.770
[Fang]

20:46.790 --> 20:48.590
[Fang] [Original Location]
[Recycle Bin Files]

20:49.920 --> 20:50.720
What's wrong?

20:53.720 --> 20:55.920
I have something urgent to deal with.

20:56.920 --> 20:57.590
Go ahead.

21:06.070 --> 21:09.750
[Forward] [Li's Phone Backup]

21:09.770 --> 21:10.310
[Sending]

21:10.360 --> 21:12.340
[Inbox]

21:12.370 --> 21:12.960
[Li's Phone Backup]

21:17.890 --> 21:20.370
[Li's Phone Backup]

21:20.680 --> 21:22.680
How did Qian Fei know I needed these?

21:24.440 --> 21:27.190
She bumped into me earlier
and brought you up,

21:27.720 --> 21:29.680
so I just mentioned it casually.

21:31.350 --> 21:32.280
Leave it for now.

21:32.350 --> 21:34.750
Let's find the contract and contact Legal.

21:37.250 --> 21:40.160
[Li's Phone Backup]

21:49.440 --> 21:50.230
Look at this.

21:53.920 --> 21:54.650
Not this one.

22:08.550 --> 22:09.030
[Pretentious Li]

22:09.030 --> 22:09.930
[Latest Projects]

22:10.040 --> 22:12.130
[Last Modified: May 26, 2021]

22:12.130 --> 22:12.310
[Processing]

22:12.400 --> 22:13.240
[Pretentious Li]

22:22.130 --> 22:23.270
[The folder below was modified]

22:23.300 --> 22:24.890
[at exactly the time of Shanlifang's
charity banquet,]

22:24.910 --> 22:26.490
[when Liao Shiyu was speaking on stage.]

22:26.560 --> 22:27.020
[Li's Phone Backup]

22:28.000 --> 22:30.460
Boss, this data
haven't been organized yet.

22:31.240 --> 22:32.170
Here's the plan.

22:32.440 --> 22:33.640
Contact Legal first.

22:33.640 --> 22:35.000
Then have them prepare the materials

22:35.000 --> 22:36.330
and contact the lawyer.

22:36.480 --> 22:37.400
As for this data,

22:37.400 --> 22:39.270
I will send them to your email later.

22:39.270 --> 22:40.130
Let's split up.

22:41.480 --> 22:43.350
Alright, I'll go right now.

22:43.480 --> 22:44.160
Go now.

22:56.350 --> 22:57.480
Xin You,

22:57.480 --> 22:59.880
I have something urgent to do.
I'm leaving.

23:01.700 --> 23:03.060
Are you leaving so soon?

23:03.440 --> 23:04.770
At least stay for a meal.

23:05.200 --> 23:05.860
No, thanks.

23:06.270 --> 23:07.800
Well, I'll head back first.

23:08.350 --> 23:10.270
I think I need to take this computer back.

23:10.270 --> 23:12.270
I'll send a new one over
after I return to Shanghai.

23:12.270 --> 23:13.880
I'll copy all the files and documents

23:13.880 --> 23:15.020
of that teacher to the new computer.

23:15.020 --> 23:16.280
Please let him know.

23:16.400 --> 23:16.900
Okay.

23:16.960 --> 23:18.360
Alright, I'll get going.

23:18.440 --> 23:19.500
Thank you, Xin You.

23:19.550 --> 23:20.210
No problem.

23:27.740 --> 23:29.730
[Li Yifei]

23:37.180 --> 23:39.030
[I contacted Weibo customer service.]

23:39.060 --> 23:41.100
[My password
was also changed at that time.]

23:49.350 --> 23:50.370
Well done.

23:51.480 --> 23:52.610
I'm a professional.

24:13.510 --> 24:15.640
[I've figured out a plan.
I'll contact you later.]

24:43.300 --> 24:47.670
[Zhizhong Construction Investment
Securities Co., Ltd]

24:58.810 --> 25:03.720
[Zhizhong Construction Investment
Securities Co., Ltd]

26:38.160 --> 26:39.220
What are you doing?

26:43.070 --> 26:43.730
Hello, sir.

26:44.200 --> 26:46.070
We received a complaint
that you're disturbing our members.

26:46.070 --> 26:47.550
Please leave immediately.

26:47.550 --> 26:49.410
A complaint? Who am I disturbing?

26:50.350 --> 26:51.880
Please leave immediately.

26:52.720 --> 26:53.310
I'm looking for someone.

26:53.310 --> 26:53.880
Sorry.

26:55.030 --> 26:56.110
Do you know which room the guest

26:56.110 --> 26:57.510
you're looking for is in?

27:01.790 --> 27:02.990
Vice President Liao?

27:03.510 --> 27:04.240
Director Li?

27:04.860 --> 27:05.740
I found her.

27:11.680 --> 27:12.280
Thank you.

27:14.270 --> 27:15.270
You can leave now.

27:20.350 --> 27:21.680
The IP address of 0.33

27:21.750 --> 27:23.410
appeared here several times.

27:26.000 --> 27:27.350
Do you mean

27:27.790 --> 27:28.850
he is a member here?

27:31.000 --> 27:32.880
I've got Ritz's member list.

27:33.110 --> 27:34.680
But I don't know many of them.

27:34.680 --> 27:37.140
However,
my father should know most of them.

27:37.590 --> 27:38.350
Can I see it?

27:40.920 --> 27:41.590
Well...

27:44.240 --> 27:45.440
Vice President Liao,

27:45.920 --> 27:46.620
you don't suspect

27:46.620 --> 27:48.920
that I have something to do with this,
do you?

27:48.920 --> 27:49.680
Not really.

27:50.070 --> 27:50.800
Director Li,

27:51.030 --> 27:52.920
when you gave me a hint
at the group that day,

27:52.920 --> 27:55.070
I knew this had nothing to do with you.

27:56.680 --> 27:57.510
It's just...

28:03.240 --> 28:03.900
Okay.

28:06.590 --> 28:08.250
I hope you can keep it a secret.

28:09.200 --> 28:09.930
Don't worry.

28:20.400 --> 28:22.970
[Ritz Exclusive Club Member List]

28:27.640 --> 28:32.420
[Sang Shiqi]

28:40.030 --> 28:42.050
This person is very close
to your father now, right?

28:40.170 --> 28:42.180
[Sang Shiqi]

28:49.960 --> 28:51.190
Then it's better

28:52.030 --> 28:54.430
not to let your father
see this list for now.

29:05.300 --> 29:06.800
[Sang Shiqi]

30:54.880 --> 30:57.340
Boss, this data
haven't been organized yet.

31:01.610 --> 31:02.790
[Qian Fei]

31:09.730 --> 31:12.140
[Qian Fei]

31:12.430 --> 31:14.090
[All]

31:21.350 --> 31:21.830
Hello?

31:22.160 --> 31:23.290
Is Qian Fei with you?

31:24.400 --> 31:25.090
No.

31:26.920 --> 31:28.050
She went to Chengdu.

31:28.550 --> 31:29.950
Why did she go to Chengdu?

31:30.880 --> 31:33.240
To help you find your lost phone data.

31:33.830 --> 31:34.890
To Chengdu?

31:35.590 --> 31:36.970
Fei donated her old computer

31:36.970 --> 31:38.200
to Xin You and his team.

31:38.200 --> 31:39.210
She thinks there might still be

31:39.210 --> 31:40.500
your data on it.

31:40.920 --> 31:41.550
I see.

31:44.020 --> 31:45.880
[Xin You]

31:55.550 --> 31:57.750
Xin You, is Qian Fei with you?

31:58.640 --> 31:59.860
She left in a hurry,

32:00.270 --> 32:03.000
saying she would catch
the earliest flight back.

32:03.920 --> 32:04.440
Okay.

32:05.790 --> 32:06.390
Thank you.

32:10.350 --> 32:14.560
[Tianfu] [Hongqiao]

32:19.860 --> 32:24.700
[Exit]

32:51.750 --> 32:52.340
Miss.

32:53.510 --> 32:55.440
Do you recognize the car behind us?

32:57.030 --> 32:57.920
That black car?

32:59.440 --> 33:00.200
No.

33:03.050 --> 33:04.970
[Qian Fei]

33:09.400 --> 33:11.000
Qian Fei, answer your phone.

33:24.680 --> 33:25.720
What's wrong with this car?

33:25.720 --> 33:27.110
Is the driver crazy?

33:39.880 --> 33:40.930
[Qian Fei]

33:57.070 --> 33:59.010
Sir, stop the car. Stop the car!

34:16.360 --> 34:17.710
Stop the car first.
Don't engage with him.

34:17.710 --> 34:19.040
Are you out of your mind?

34:36.230 --> 34:37.909
Hello, is this 110?

34:42.880 --> 34:44.230
Yes, there's a car

34:44.230 --> 34:45.230
following...

34:48.940 --> 34:50.920
[Qian Fei]

34:51.630 --> 34:53.840
Hello, where are you?

34:54.630 --> 34:56.090
Are you Qian Fei's friend?

34:56.280 --> 34:57.550
I'm from the police station.

34:57.550 --> 34:58.880
She just got into a car accident
and was sent to the hospital.

34:58.880 --> 34:59.920
We have her phone.

35:01.710 --> 35:02.640
Which hospital?

35:20.640 --> 35:21.410
[Public Security]

35:22.920 --> 35:24.540
[Emergency]

35:23.590 --> 35:24.760
This is the emergency center.

35:24.760 --> 35:25.760
We have a patient from a car accident.

35:25.760 --> 35:28.760
Prepare 1,000 milliliters
of type O blood immediately.

35:28.760 --> 35:29.590
Okay.

35:37.000 --> 35:38.800
Nurse, there's a...

35:39.070 --> 35:40.600
Nurse, a girl...

35:41.320 --> 35:42.590
was brought here this morning.

35:42.590 --> 35:44.360
How is she doing now? Where is she?

35:44.360 --> 35:45.330
Name and age?

35:45.480 --> 35:48.550
Qian Fei, 29 years old.

35:48.570 --> 35:49.900
Where is she? How is she?

35:59.550 --> 36:00.280
Who are you?

36:00.440 --> 36:01.110
You can't go in!

36:01.110 --> 36:01.800
Who are you?

36:01.840 --> 36:02.800
If you're not the patient's family,

36:02.800 --> 36:03.730
wait over there.

36:04.070 --> 36:05.590
I'm her boyfriend.

36:06.280 --> 36:06.810
Qian Fei!

36:06.880 --> 36:07.800
This is a hospital!

36:07.800 --> 36:08.670
Qian Fei!

36:23.800 --> 36:24.480
Li Yifei?

36:52.680 --> 36:56.710
♪ Also, there's no need
to force the closest bonds ♪

36:59.280 --> 37:04.050
♪ I might be left alone,
but I have your warmth ♪

37:07.380 --> 37:12.190
♪ And there's no need to dwell
on right or wrong—not because of fear ♪

37:14.230 --> 37:20.030
♪ A hug far outweighs endless apologies ♪

37:16.720 --> 37:18.060
You got me so scared!

37:21.300 --> 37:23.460
♪ I'll show you the wider world ♪

37:24.330 --> 37:27.460
♪ It's only in blazing bright
that I am who I am ♪

37:29.030 --> 37:34.750
♪ Quietly carry it all, like a harbor
sheltering your drifting soul ♪

37:30.960 --> 37:32.290
What are you doing here?

37:35.070 --> 37:35.410
I...

37:35.440 --> 37:36.170
I didn't mean you.

37:36.050 --> 37:38.150
♪ When you return to your peaceful life ♪

37:38.320 --> 37:39.360
What are you doing here?

37:39.070 --> 37:42.150
♪ The light at home glows warm
day and night ♪

37:43.820 --> 37:45.160
♪ Stay forever by each other's side ♪

37:44.480 --> 37:45.190
Does...

37:46.070 --> 37:49.490
♪ Like the stars and the moon
hanging brightly in the sky ♪

37:47.840 --> 37:48.670
Does it hurt?

37:50.770 --> 37:52.860
♪ I'll show you the wider world ♪

37:51.150 --> 37:52.690
Are you hurt anywhere else?

37:53.070 --> 37:54.070
I'm fine.

37:53.750 --> 37:56.660
♪ It's only in blazing bright
that I am who I am ♪

37:58.260 --> 38:04.160
♪ Quietly carry it all, like a harbor
sheltering your drifting soul ♪

38:05.390 --> 38:07.370
♪ When you return to your peaceful life ♪

38:05.840 --> 38:07.040
I'm glad you're okay.

38:08.320 --> 38:09.030
I'm glad you're okay.

38:08.630 --> 38:12.000
♪ The light at home glows warm
day and night ♪

38:13.610 --> 38:15.680
♪ Stay forever by each other's side ♪

38:17.500 --> 38:24.940
♪ Like the stars and the moon
hanging brightly in the sky ♪

38:27.670 --> 38:28.900
Let me see your wound.

38:33.280 --> 38:34.010
Does it hurt?

38:55.280 --> 38:55.970
Oh, right.

38:56.920 --> 38:58.320
Why are you two together?

38:59.110 --> 38:59.910
Don't forget,

39:00.070 --> 39:01.600
you're not fighting alone.

39:50.440 --> 39:52.570
Is this why you didn't answer my calls?

39:54.030 --> 39:55.760
Couldn't you wait a bit longer?

39:56.440 --> 39:58.480
Chairman Liao, in that computer,

39:58.520 --> 40:00.440
there's Shanlifang's original data

40:00.440 --> 40:02.440
and evidence of me framing Qian Fei.

40:02.550 --> 40:03.510
Once exposed,

40:03.550 --> 40:06.410
it will definitely affect
Shanlifang's next plan.

40:08.000 --> 40:09.960
Now you're thinking about Shanlifang?

40:09.960 --> 40:11.070
That day in the car,

40:11.150 --> 40:12.280
what did you tell me?

40:13.840 --> 40:16.770
Mr. Liao, the reason I did this

40:16.920 --> 40:20.350
was to help you face the problem early on.

40:20.480 --> 40:22.220
Otherwise,

40:22.280 --> 40:24.400
the consequences
Shanlifang would face later

40:24.400 --> 40:27.200
would be far worse
than the current losses.

40:28.190 --> 40:29.250
Don't you think so?

40:29.840 --> 40:31.220
You have a glib tongue.

40:31.510 --> 40:33.110
If you really cared about me,

40:33.150 --> 40:35.010
you should have told me to my face.

40:36.760 --> 40:38.000
The reason you caused

40:38.000 --> 40:39.730
such a huge public controversy

40:39.760 --> 40:41.700
was to destroy Shanlifang.

40:41.840 --> 40:42.440
No, no.

40:42.550 --> 40:45.150
Well... I did cause
a huge public controversy,

40:45.280 --> 40:47.560
but I never intended

40:47.670 --> 40:49.590
to destroy Shanlifang.

40:50.510 --> 40:51.640
Quite the opposite.

40:52.150 --> 40:54.820
My future and fortune

40:54.880 --> 40:57.110
are now closely tied to Shanlifang.

40:59.400 --> 41:00.440
Nonsense.

41:01.360 --> 41:02.220
Chairman Liao,

41:03.150 --> 41:06.070
you will definitely thank me
in the future.

41:07.000 --> 41:10.460
You could say this was an indirect way
of saving the situation.

41:12.000 --> 41:13.510
Think about it carefully.

41:13.800 --> 41:16.600
Given your precious daughter's
stubborn temper,

41:16.880 --> 41:19.700
if I hadn't suddenly
pulled a stunt like this,

41:20.000 --> 41:22.840
Shanlifang would probably have missed

41:22.840 --> 41:24.770
the best opportunity to go public.

41:27.360 --> 41:29.510
You mean... Fulaxida?

41:30.670 --> 41:31.840
You're wise.

41:32.280 --> 41:33.360
Before this,

41:33.630 --> 41:35.660
you were interested in Fulaxida

41:36.190 --> 41:37.410
and even made some

41:37.550 --> 41:39.750
small-scale investments through me.

41:41.280 --> 41:42.620
To tell you the truth,

41:42.840 --> 41:47.080
I have already taken action

41:47.550 --> 41:49.280
against Fulaxida and Li Yifei.

41:52.550 --> 41:54.660
If we get into the details,

41:55.150 --> 41:56.300
this matter...

41:57.590 --> 41:59.230
is already inextricably linked

41:59.230 --> 42:00.800
to you, Chairman Liao.

42:04.710 --> 42:06.630
It sounds like you're threatening me.

42:06.630 --> 42:07.860
No, Chairman Liao.

42:07.960 --> 42:10.050
How could this be a threat?

42:10.440 --> 42:12.560
It's a reminder.

42:14.480 --> 42:18.250
I think you...

42:19.190 --> 42:20.820
should be... a bit braver.

42:21.400 --> 42:25.100
Think about it. It's already clear

42:25.230 --> 42:27.430
that Shanlifang won't be going public.

42:28.000 --> 42:29.920
Why not focus all your efforts

42:29.960 --> 42:31.240
into Fulaxida,

42:31.400 --> 42:33.540
a brand-new opportunity?

42:38.840 --> 42:40.360
So reckless, huh?

42:41.550 --> 42:44.260
Now look, Shiyu is investigating you.

42:44.630 --> 42:46.440
Li Qiansheng has also intervened.

42:46.440 --> 42:47.100
Seriously.

42:47.760 --> 42:49.110
Before anyone else even makes a move,

42:49.110 --> 42:52.050
you've already fallen into
the trap you set for yourself.

42:52.050 --> 42:53.710
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.110 --> 42:55.860
The person you've had
in your heart from the very beginning

42:55.860 --> 42:56.530
was me,

42:56.710 --> 42:57.320
right?

42:58.210 --> 42:59.060
Qian Fei,

42:59.480 --> 43:01.590
may I continue to like you?

43:02.590 --> 43:03.970
Let me protect you.

43:04.620 --> 43:05.170
Okay?

43:07.160 --> 43:08.470
Let me tell you,

43:08.590 --> 43:10.730
it's inevitable that we'll see each other

43:10.730 --> 43:12.030
a lot at work.

43:13.180 --> 43:14.220
So from now on,

43:14.250 --> 43:15.870
we need to set some ground rules.
